/*
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Application entrypoint
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------
|
| Minimal main package: delegates to src/app.Run() so wiring lives under src/
| and this file stays a thin process entry (build with go build -o api .).
| Replace or extend if you need custom signal handling or multiple servers.
|
